    "policy": "MIC plus explicit HC50/IC50/CC50 or 50% hemolysis/cell-death labels; positive scalar concentrations and inequalities only; uM or ug/mL native units; individually resolvable common target strains and common host labels with documented exact aliases; same native entry and reference ordinal. Excludes ambiguous text, intervals, mean+-SD and unmatched host aliases. Counts describe an audited parsable subset, not all DBAASP links."
  },
